{"id":"00186","root":"uni00186_1","name":{"ja":"セラステス","en":"Cerastes"},"title":{"ja":"【電磁砲装備】","en":"【EM Cannon Gear】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【電磁砲装備】 セラステス","en":"【EM Cannon Gear】 Cerastes"},"element":"Superhuman","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2019-04-30","limited":true,"characterId":19,"profile":{"ja":"人間界で傭兵業を営む高位魔族。上半身は人、下半身は大蛇の姿でナーガ族と呼ばれる蛇神の一族。死と隣り合わせの傭兵稼業を天職だと考えている戦闘狂。人間界で人に育てられたためナーガ族である自覚はなく、基本的に人間の姿で行動している。本来、ナーガ族は自力で人に化ける事が出来るが、人に育てられたセラステスはその方法を知らず、仮面の力を借りて変化している。幼い時から蛇人間とからかわれてきたトラウマからか、人間には敵愾心を持っており、特にお高くとまっている者や、正義を振りかざす者のことは嫌っている。同族を探す旅の中でふうまに出会った。傭兵としての経験から、兵器の扱いには長けているのに加え、ナーガ族の並外れた視力と筋力により、重く扱いづらい兵器も軽々と使いこなす。新しい武器を手に入れて喜ぶ姿は若干子供っぽい。","en":"(Cerastes, she/her) A high-ranking demon who works as a mercenary in the Human Realm. Her upper body is human, while her lower half is that of a great serpent, making her part of the naga clan of snake deities. She sees the death-filled life of a mercenary as her true calling and is a battle-mad. Raised by humans, she has no awareness of her naga heritage and generally operates in human form. Though nagas can normally shapeshift at will, Cerastes, having been raised by people, never learned the method and relies on a mask's power to transform. Traumatized by being teased as a \"snake-human\" in childhood, she harbors hostility toward humans, especially the haughty and those who brandish justice. She met Fuuma while searching for others of her kind. Her mercenary experience makes her adept with weapons, and her extraordinary naga eyesight and strength let her handle heavy, unwieldy arms with ease. She displays a childlike delight whenever she acquires a new weapon."},"illustrator":"みこやん","voiceActor":"榊木春乃","forms":[{"id":"uni00186_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1006,2012],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[157,314],"def":[99,198],"spd":[44,44],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":35,"skills":["1","180001"],"evolve":[["evo00001",5],["evo00002",15],["evo00003",5],["evo00017",